      <H3>Course type</H3>Advanced course 
      <H3>Periodicity</H3>Irregular 
      <H3>Intended audience</H3>Students who want to get an introduction to 
      optimization for learning and planning. 
      <H3>Contents</H3>The course is based on material developed by
      Anders Hansson, Johan Löfberg, and Daniel Axehill,
      Linkoping University and Martin Andersen, Technical
      University of Denmark. A more detailed 
      description of the contents is given in the <A 
      href="http://www.control.isy.liu.se/~hansson/optimization-for-learning/schedule.html">schedule</A>. 

